    rdfs:label "Chapters 16 to 20 decks and pages meet the owner's rulings on decks and pages"@en ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin "Owner's instruction 2026-11-26 16:57 Istanbul: 'Let's finish incoming chapters first as they are candidates for incoming lectures. After the completion we can return to the covered chapters in previous sessions.' Read as chapters 16 to 20, the chapters after chapter 15 that have a deck." ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "The chapter 16 (SQLite Databases), chapter 17 (PDF and Word Documents), chapter 18 (CSV, JSON and XML), chapter 19 (Time and Scheduling) and chapter 20 (Email, Texts and Push Notifications) decks and interactive pages, already released, are corrected so that they meet the owner's rulings on decks and pages (one thing taught per slide, notes that carry the lecture and speak to the reader, a Slide code tab, a top menu item that runs the slide examples in order, plain code without prompts, only taught Python, no everyday analogies, checks and reviews recorded before release), with each chapter's approved content, stories and examples unchanged except where a ruling forces a change, reusing the conversion built for chapters 10 to 17." ;
    backlog:missionFor ex:Backlog13,
        ex:Register_Ch1620corr .

